---
---
<section class="relative bg-brand-dark py-12 md:py-16 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
    <img
      src="/ground-nature.jpeg"
      alt=""
      aria-hidden="true"
      class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center opacity-20"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-dark via-brand-dark/95 to-brand-dark/80"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 lg:gap-6">

      <div class="flex items-start gap-4 max-w-2xl">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-brand-green/20 border border-brand-green/40 flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-brand-green" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 7V3m8 4V3m-9 8h10M5 21h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-brand-green text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-2">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-green animate-pulse"></span>
            Temporada de Fertilización 2026
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight leading-snug">
            Prepara tu Cultivo Antes de la Temporada de Siembra
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm sm:text-base text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Los suelos que se preparan a tiempo rinden más. Agenda tu visita técnica gratuita con un asesor de tu zona y asegura la referencia Amcopaste que tu cultivo necesita.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a
        href="https://wa.me/573000000000"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 w-full lg:w-auto shrink-0 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg bg-brand-green hover:bg-[#00633a] text-white font-bold text-sm sm:text-base transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl shadow-emerald-950/30 hover:-translate-y-0.5 group"
      >
        Reservar Asesoría Gratuita
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 sm:h-5 sm:w-5 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
        </svg>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>